# Frontend (apps/admin_api/frontend, Phase 8) — the `dev`/`runtime` stages
# never need the frontend's own node_modules/dist; the Dockerfile's
# dedicated `frontend-build` stage installs deps and builds dist/ itself
# from a clean COPY of the frontend source, and only that stage's own
# dist/ output is copied into `runtime`.
